            "id": 152195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Odpowiedź z API wygląda następująco: <code>{\"title\": \"Sky Trails\", \"pages\": 240}</code>.</p><p>Uzupełnij dostęp do słownika, który wyświetla liczbę stron książki.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"book.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(data[\" /><text value=\"&quot;pages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;data&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"240\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"pages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check the Status Code",
            "id": 152196,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij atrybut response, który pozwala warunkowi sprawdzać kod stanu <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"status.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"success_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if response.status_code == 200:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij atrybut response, który pozwala warunkowi sprawdzać kod stanu <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"status.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"success_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if response.status_code == 200:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>"
